    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=\nCreate a professional HTML email newsletter titled\n\"Daily AI News\".\n\nUse the supplied article data to create a separate card\nfor each news story.\n\nEach card must include:\n1. Headline\n2. Relevant image using the supplied imageUrl\n3. Context summary\n4. Why it matters\n5. Clickable original article link\n\nDesign requirements:\n- White background with dark navy headings.\n- Images displayed above or beside each headline.\n- Rounded article cards with consistent spacing.\n- Responsive layout suitable for mobile email clients.\n- Use inline CSS for email compatibility.\n- Use the actual imageUrl supplied for each article.\n- If no valid image URL exists, omit the image.\n- Do not invent article details or image URLs.\n\nReturn the complete HTML email, not Markdown\nor a description of the HTML.\n\n\nIMPORTANT RULES FOR ARTICLE LINKS:\n\n1. Use the exact original article URL supplied in the RSS data.\n2. The original URL is stored in the article's \"link\" field.\n3. Never invent, rewrite, shorten, or replace an article URL.\n4. Never use example.com, example.org, or other placeholder URLs.\n5. Each \"Read Full Story\" button must link to the\n   corresponding article's original URL.\n6. If a valid URL is unavailable, omit the button.\n\nGenerate the link in this format:\n\n<a href=\"ORIGINAL_ARTICLE_URL\"\n   target=\"_blank\"\n   style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;\n   background-color:#082747;color:#ffffff;\n   text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;\">\n   Read Full Story\n</a>\n\nReplace ORIGINAL_ARTICLE_URL with the actual link\nfrom that specific article.\n\n\nIMAGE RULES:\n\n- Use the exact imageUrl supplied for the article.\n- Never invent an image URL.\n- Use only publicly accessible image URLs.\n- Do not use an article webpage URL as an image URL.\n- If the image URL is missing or invalid, omit the image.\n- Preserve the original article link separately.\n\nGenerate the image element as:\n\n<img src=\"ACTUAL_IMAGE_URL\"\n     alt=\"Article headline\"\n     width=\"620\"\n     style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:620px;\n     height:auto;border-radius:8px;\">\n\nReplace ACTUAL_IMAGE_URL with the supplied imageUrl.\n",
        "batching": {}
      },
